<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="dots" aria-hidden="true" style="width:120px;height:120px;top:40px;left:30px"></div>
  <div class="section-inner centered">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--accent-text)">Business Insights</span>
    <span class="script script-xl" style="color:var(--accent-text);display:block">See What Time Really Does</span>
    <h2 class="headline">The longer they stay, the further ahead they get.</h2>
    <div class="curve"></div>
    <p class="subhead" style="max-width:640px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">Your business insights turn your own data into a clear picture of how students and the center are doing, from enrollment and retention to performance. Here is one view: length of enrollment plotted against above-grade results, real and anonymized. No spreadsheets to decode, no digging through five tools.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="section-inner" style="max-width:900px;margin-top:1rem">
    <div class="chart-frame"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="2235" height="804" src="/images/grade-chart.webp" alt="Above vs below grade by length of study, real center data"></div>
    <p class="chart-note">Real data from a live Center Book center. Individual students are never identified.</p>
    <div class="centered" style="margin-top:1.8rem">
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-founding" data-cta="Contact Us">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
